{
  "id": "PHP.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "PHP",
  "reference": "Filipi 3",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PHP 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alhhe'eesaywo gár án ni oo', hhaee'eé', qwalaala/é' baraá Aakoó wa ale, aníng a slaaqaataaká gooiro tidá' naa qaroó dirhúng i gooiím, asma i qoón dirhunge ngiwa inkii/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti harmagahhe' dír mukduú adór seeaawe, dír sagadiyuuseedár muruú tlákw inslaaslaw, mukdá' slaqo gi tlaquú wa slaá' ar al/utlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala múk taa al/utlín a atén, ar al/utloodár ló'. Qeeruú Mungú atén ti gan'aamiis baraá sluufayrene. Atén tin xirfayeemisaán as Kristo Yesu kilós. Gár hatlá' ar ta haraxuaan i káhh ar tlehhema'aá tawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá tawo geera bir bu'uutiyá', aníng gár ni da'ayuumiit i káhh. Umuúqo heewo geera bar tlehhema'aá tawo gin haraxu'utír wa slaa', geera alók aníng i baá/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng tina al/uútl bál dakaate, alaá tiwa xwaylúy. Aníng a heé xoorór Israeli, heé tlahhoó Benyamini, aníng a heé Ebrania, tam xwayliitér'eé' a múk Ebrania. Kángw hara'aya ooharo aníng a heé Farisayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilakaaharu una ló'wa tleéhh gawaá daanduú hara'aya ooharo, tam múk kríshaanáy nguri slahh'eemiís. Geera barnaxes hotaá ganaa'á' kin slaslaya ar hara'aya boo/eesa, geera alók aníng ti xaslxaansli wásl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala muruudá' sleémeero aáng naa harafaár tawa slaasláw dir'eene, hám daxta muruudá' u harafadiít tawa /aareema dir'eene as Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala a muruuwí kiloseká. Mura' sleémeero un harafadiít tawa /aareemaá kilá' asma Kristo Yesu Aakooeé' nguwa xuú', gaarí a gár afhhamít ta muruú hatlá' sleémeero ba/a. Mura' sleémeero una geexáw as inós, mura' sleémeero una harafaár tawa xwaansloó tawo, as kahhó' Kristo nguwa slaw, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee niwa haragwaa' dirós i alé. Daxta aníng hotaá ganaa'á' awa naa sláw as hara'aya ngiwa boo/eés, i kahhiyá'. Hotaá ganaa'á' awa ni xuu' a kudá' kilós hee i slay as Yesu Kristo nguwa haratlintií', an kudá' amór Mungú dahhá', as haratlintaao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gár án ni leelehhiit a wak kilós. A Kristo nguwa xuu', nee /uuruú waasle/uuwós nguwa slaw, nee niwa haragwaa' baraá slahh'amaayeerós i alé. Nee aníng tawa adór inós baraá gwa'araarose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng masók harahhifo a koóm ar tiwa waaslee/atisi baraá múk aa qaátl wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng a kaahaaká amoodá' ta i qwaatlaan aga i hardáh qaroó alé, slám a kaahaaká gan'amu ugwa qaroó sláw. Ala ilakaaharu un tlehhiít niwa kumiit as niwa hardah nee gadaádá' ngiwa oh, tidaádá' Kristo Yesu isa ateét, qoomár iwa óh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sla'aaruúse aníng adór gadaádá' ngira i hardihiiká a xuú'. Gár án ni tlehhiit a tí kilós, muruudá' naa alií geexáw un gunqareemiís, nee kudá' geeraaeé' i dirií' un i ti'i'iím. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ló'wa naagamiís as amoodá' ta i qwaatlaan ngiwa i hardah, as slaasláwadá' Mungú isa ateét ar loohír Yesu ngiwa slaw, tidá' niwa hoot gawaá doorí wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ateéká' sleémeero awa ganaa'á', gár tiwa hariím a adoorí an inslaslaawaán. Ala kuungá' bar adór hatlá' aga inslasleeré' gawaá umuúqo gaaro, Mungú muruudá' ngu kuungá' i geehhooatis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala atén sleémeero gár tiwa hariím masók an kumiitaán ar digir wakeetingwdá' tara iimu/uumaán.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hhaee'eé', kuungá' sleémeero adoorí án nir hoot nar hootaak. Asma atén a slaqsaay dirhunge. Kudá' hootá' adór atén nir hootaan ló'wa ga/aawaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma án kaangwí ngwa qaroó oó' geerií ale daqtá yaariire, ala hám daxta ngun malé inkií/ ooaro ar hhirhheeri, asma múk yaariír adór ir hooti a adór wakuusér gwa'arár Kristo ar gawaá msalaába. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín i loohír i dirii'iyá', tidár baraá qwanoó kaw. Munguúín a gura'. Muruú tir xirfayeemisi a kuduú murér koóm. Muruú ta inslaslay oo baraaká' yaamu kilós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala atén a yaamuloouusér gawaá doori. Slám atén Aakoorén Yesu Kristo u daamaaramaán niwa hardihi gawaá doorí wa aleeró, tiwa ba/amisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós slaqoorén kuká' hhitiruutá' giri warqees nee tari adór slaqwtós tidár xirfuú koom. Inós adoorí tleehhamooro ga aleesláy. Asma inós /uuru gu kón oo mura' sleémeero nguwa qaasi baraá aleesleemuuwós i alé.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
